### Signup
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John",
  "email": "john@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}
